DESCRIPTION:Michelle is a TV and radio personality and comedian who has bee
 n performing her new stand-up hour  Wait\, Why Don’t I Know You ? in LA 
 and NY. Her 2024 The Big Natural Tour also wrapped to sold out shows\, rave
  reviews\, and a slot as a NY Times Critics Pick. She hosts The Michelle Co
 llins Show every day featuring interviews\, news\, and a stream-of-consciou
 sness energy that has become her signature style\, taking the show to Patre
 on after hosting it on SiriusXM's Radio Andy for 5 years.  She is the co-h
 ost of On The Box\, the official Britbox recap podcast produced by the BBC.
  She recently headlined The Three Clubs for the 2026 Netflix is a Joke fest
 ival and sold-out Dynasty Typewriter in LA.\n\nMichelle is one of a handful
  of lucky ladies who can call herself a  former host of ABC's The View  a
 longside Whoopi Goldberg\, as well as hosting a slew of reality TV after sh
 ows for ABC's Bachelor In Paradise\, TLC's 90 Day Fiancé\, and Lifetime's 
 Married at First Sight. She is a frequent contributor and co-host on the 4t
 h hour of NBC's The Today Show\, is a recurring guest on Bravo's Watch What
  Happens Live\, and was a featured moderator at Bravo's Bravocon this past 
 November.  She toured the country with cast of Netflix's “Queer Eye” l
 ast year\, opening for and moderating the beloved cast of the hit show.\n\n
 Couple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage cred
